  "description": "Cho-Ah, who was running a peaceful and ordinary cafe, gets summoned by a demon just by signing a bank statement. Jin-Hyeok, the demon who was summoned in an absurd manner, demands that Cho-Ah make a contract to receive his soul in exchange for giving him his life through sexual intercourse... \n\n *\"If it's sexual intercourse... how far...?\" \n\n\"Shall we check?\"*\n\nThe passionate life exchange with the mischievous demon and the sudden visit of the demons change her ordinary daily life completely! \n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated)",
